"P1975940342" "<em><em><em>Good work people, we got this area cleared!<em>We just gotta hold off now 'till we get the other end cleared of PPD.<em>Yo, {HeroName}, come over here, we should have ourselves a little chat."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3474961867" "<em>GHOULS! Push them BACK!<em>You all, form a perimeter around those civilians,<em>we can't get their deaths placed on us!<em><em><em><em><em><em><em><em>Dynamite, form up on Jammer, keep your line of sight tight!<em><em><em><em>YEAH! Come ON! We're doing this!<em><em><em>Show those chompers who the real SLAMMERS are!<em><em>COME ON! Keep formation, you think we can take down Cole if we can't beat some stupid group of chompers?!"
