"P3367356239" "<em><em><em><em><em><em><em><em><em>Maybe...we were wrong about all of you..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1614845382" "I-I don't want to die, please don't kill me!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P829706426" "<em><em><em><em><em><em><em><em><em>W-why...why are you helping us?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P463874901" "<em>Why...I thought you all wanted us dead?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3743638265" "<em><em><em><em><em><em><em>First Destroyers...then Terrorists...now Ghouls...!<em>What's happening to Praetoria?!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4107271739" "Driftwood"
