// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2973194152" "Defeated PPD"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P329139359" "Defeated Resistance"
// Script Variable PET_NAME :
"P4018337905" "Calvin Scott"
// Script Variable PET_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2239863859" "Over here, {HeroName}. We need to talk."
// Script Variable SayOnRescue :
"P2791824994" "Alright, we don't have a lot of time."
// Script Variable SayOnRecapture :
"P4092859687" "You cant' handle the Scott!"
// Script Variable SayOnRerescue :
"P310266183" "I thought you'd left me."
// Script Variable SayOnStranded :
"P115395210" "{HeroName}, not so fast."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P378383334" "I'm glad to see you made it down here."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4089460800" "Good, you've got the inspiration. Now you need to use it."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2060277848" "Great, now let's get out of here.<em t=3><em>I know the location of a Resistance base nearby."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2849224894" "We've got company."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1886213980" "These tunnels are crawling with P.P.D."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3294592935" "Uhoh, looks like they've called in backup.<em>The Lieutenant is going to be difficult to get past."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3112036478" "Right, he's taken care of.<em>Let's go."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2426458964" "Just a little bit further and we're at the Resistance base."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P673351815" "PPD Trooper"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1989060326" "You crossed the wrong officer, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1033739574" "Can't believe this...stuck down here...while those cocky Powers Division get to do whatever they want..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P770798426" "This'll be my chance...survive this, I'll show them that the Powers Division can't replace us..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4121544367" "Powers Division? Just don't get in the way.<em>They're cleaning up the rest up ahead."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3213698377" "Just you and me, {HeroName}. Make a move, I dare you."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4189517827" "<em>Oh? Just goes to show that Powers are just going to collapse on themselves."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2221878334" "<em><em>We'll show him just what exactly we're made of."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3285636811" "Do you even care about Praetoria, like we do?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4042684605" "Just give me a reason to blast you, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 3 Loyalist_Member_One :
"P2733997578" "You're not going anywhere, terrorist."
// 4 Loyalist_Member_One :
"P2607104809" "Your attacks on the people of Praetoria end today!"
// 12 Loyalist_Leader :
"P2805483132" "<em t=4 d=4>{HeroName}! So, Praetor White couldn't just let the PPD handle this, huh?<em t=4 d=4>As you can see, we're finishing things up here with the Resistance.<em t=4 d=4>But I guess you're here to 'show us how it's done', aren't you?"
// 3 Loyalist_Leader :
"P4082237300" "<em t=4 d=4>Are you going to follow through on your orders..."
// 3 Loyalist_Leader :
"P972001013" "<em t=4 d=4>...and take down this Resistance scum?"
// LeftText :
"P578460785" "<scale 2.5><span align=center><color Paragon>Join the Resistance</color></scale><br>Fight the P.P.D. officers and help the member of the resistance escape.</span><br><br><color Paragon>Joining the Resistance</color><br>Resistance members oppose the regime of Emperor Cole, seeking to reveal the true cost of utopia to a populace kept blissfully unaware.<br><br><scale .8><color slategray><i>(As the story of Praetoria unfolds your character will have opportunities to change their mind and switch sides.)</i></scale>"
// RightText :
"P3469608388" "<scale 2.5><span align=center><color orange>Remain a Loyalist</color></scale><br>Aid the PPD in arresting the member of the resistance</span><br><br><color orange>Being a Loyalist</color><br>Loyalists support the vision of a peaceful and orderly civilization led by Marcus Cole. They seek to keep Praetoria a peaceful place by any means necessary.<br><br><i><scale .8><color slategray>(As the story of Praetoria unfolds your character will have opportunities to change their mind and switch sides.)</scale></i>"
// Script Variable RESISTANCE_LEADER_NAME :
"P492932491" "Wrencher"
// Script Variable LOYALIST_LEADER_NAME :
"P967906340" "Loyalist Leader"
// Script Variable LOYALIST_MEMBER_ONE_NAME :
"P2136845645" "Loyalist Member"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P225196890" "Let's show this Powers Division that the PPD can still take down scum like Wrencher!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2458738336" "Help me out of this by taking out these guys, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3652444424" "Whew, almost got myself slammed there!<em=lecture f=a>Gotta say, it's good havin' you on our side.<em=lecture f=a>We gotta figure out a game plan before you head topside, come talk to me."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P845914902" "Well done.<em=lecture f=a>You have proven your loyalty to the Emperor.<em=lecture f=a>Come here, I need to talk to you."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3085029734" "Good luck, with Praetor White. The Powers Division is not an easy job."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3596355182" "Be careful with Praetor White. He's got a sixth sense when it comes to finding spies.<em>You're going to have to play the part of a Powers Division completely."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1532814662" "I trusted you {HeroName}, I won't make the same mistake twice!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1000875998" "You're just another enemy of the state then, {HeroName}."

